eviation. The trace is not impaired for policy purposes under POL-RD-07 — 139 fixes at a 10-second interval, 100.0% coverage, zero gaps, maximum gap 0 seconds — so the 1.46 km measurement is reliable and no independent corroboration is required. No POL-RD-10 escalation trigger fires: trip identifiers all read TRP-03206, no timestamps conflict or run backwards, no charge line lacks a counterpart in the trace or trip record, and the two sides are consistent rather than contradictory. Confidence is 0.95, above the 0.70 floor, and rests on evidence at weight 1.0 (the trace and the trip record), so no discount applies; no POL-RD-06 conduct pattern is established (deviation_flags_90d 0 over 264 completed trips in 90 days) and no referral is produced. The monetary effect is nil, below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold. This is a provisional ruling made without human review; either party may appeal it once within 30 days under POL-GEN-04."
